        "Content": "Three bedroom semi detached house now available for viewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nHollywood is a small exclusive new homes development by MKN Property Group.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully designed scheme comprises a selection of A-rated 2-, 3-, and 4-bedroom family homes. \r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of a thriving suburban community that perfectly blends modern living with a tranquil, countryside atmosphere. The location benefits from excellent connectivity, with easy access to the N2, N3, and M50 road networks, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, Dublin City and Dublin Airport. \r\n\r\nHollywood offers a rare opportunity to secure a modern energy efficient home in Hollystown, one of Dublin 15’s most desirable addresses. \r\n\r\nRegister your interest now."
